 "summary": "The tensor-bundle pullback and covering continuity lemmas, `linearMapAt_pullback`, `tensorEquivOfNeZero` and the `c\u2081` tensor lemmas have no counterpart in Mathlib or Tau Ceti; the nearest analogues (`isoTensorUnitOfSectionNeZero` on smooth finite-rank cores, `inCoordinates_pullback_of_mem` for hom bundles) cannot replace them. The PR reuses `firstChernClass_eq_of_fiberwise`, `bundleTensorCommHomeomorph`, `continuous_bundleTensorMap`, `continuous_hom_bundle_iff` and `Continuous.tmul_section`, and generalises `lineCoord` in place instead of restating it.",
